'' A procedure with '...' is never an overload: declared OVERLOAD even alone, joining a set,
'' a set formed around a variadic member in either order, and any variadic constructor --
'' 12 errors on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike, on exactly these lines (2026-09-18). The
'' last pair shows a refused declaration forgotten: line 38 is not refused in turn.
'' redeclare-allowed.bas holds the variadic shapes fbc accepts.
